<%- include("../../partials/teach-head", { title: "Choose your password", teacher: null }) %>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Teacher portal</p>
    <h1>Welcome, <%= invited.name %></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The office has set up your account. Choose a password and you are in —
      there is nothing else to confirm.
    </p>

    <%#
      Name and email are shown but not editable. They come from the
      account the office created, not from this form, so an intercepted
      link cannot be turned into an account for somebody else.
    %>
    <div class="facts" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <h3>Your account</h3>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Name</dt><dd><%= invited.name %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><%= invited.email %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd><%= invited.role === "teacher" ? "Teacher" : invited.role %></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <form class="form" method="post" action="/teach/invite/<%= encodeURIComponent(token) %>" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <%- include("../../partials/password-field", {
        id: "password", name: "password", label: "Choose a password",
        autocomplete: "new-password", minlength: 10,
        error: errors.password || null,
        hint: "At least ten characters. A few unrelated words are easier to remember than a short jumble, and harder to guess.",
      }) %>

      <%#
        The two things the terms are really about, said in one sentence
        each before the link. A tick box over a link nobody opens is a
        tick box, not an agreement — and these two clauses are the ones
        the school would actually need to rely on.
      %>
      <div class="facts" style="margin-top:.25rem">
        <h3>Before you agree</h3>
        <ul style="margin:.4rem 0 0;padding-left:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;font-size:.92rem">
          <li>
            Everything the school gives you to teach with stays LangNation's
            property. You may use it to teach LangNation students and for
            nothing else — not to sell, not to publish, not in private
            lessons of your own.
          </li>
          <li>
            When you stop teaching for us, you return or delete all of it,
            along with anything holding student data.
          </li>
          <li>
            Your class lists hold real people's contact details. Keep this
            password to yourself, and tell the office at once if you think
            somebody else has it.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:1.1rem">
        <%- include("../../partials/terms-gate", {
          termsTitle: termsTitle, termsPath: termsPath, termsHtml: termsHtml,
          acceptError: errors.accept || null,
        }) %>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn-block" type="submit" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Set my password</button>
    </form>

    <p class="muted" style="font-size:.88rem;margin-top:1.5rem">
      This link works once. If something goes wrong,
      <a href="/contact">tell the office</a> and we will send a new one.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include("../../partials/portal-foot") %>
